  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oven to 425 F. Line a large rimmed sheet pan with parchment.",
    "Toss the sweet potatoes with 2 tbsp olive oil, 1/2 tsp salt, and the smoked paprika. Spread them over half of the pan.",
    "Roast the sweet potatoes for 10 minutes while you make the glaze.",
    "Whisk the maple syrup, tamari, vinegar, mustard, and garlic in a bowl. Add the tempeh slabs and turn to coat.",
    "Toss the kale with 1 tbsp olive oil, the remaining 1/2 tsp salt, and the pepper in a large bowl.",
    "Pull the pan out. Stir the sweet potatoes and lay the tempeh on the empty half. Spoon the leftover glaze over the tempeh.",
    "Roast for 10 minutes. Flip the tempeh and scatter the kale over the pan, then drizzle it with the last 1 tbsp olive oil.",
    "Roast 5 to 8 minutes more, until the sweet potatoes are tender, the kale edges are crisp, and the tempeh is browned and sticky.",
    "Serve the tempeh over the sweet potatoes and kale."
  ],
